  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Hardened CFG002 so [Required] properties whose compile-time default already satisfies RequiredAttribute no longer warn when the key is missing: non-empty string initializers (honoring AllowEmptyStrings), non-null literals on nullable value types, object-creation initializers, and constructor-bound parameter defaults cannot fail validation. Empty/whitespace string defaults, null!/default initializers, explicit parameterless new int?(), constructor defaults that never reach the property, and non-literal initializers keep warning. The generated appsettings.schema.json required array follows the same boundary.",
